//! W2 fixtures for the canister's own Solana instruction builders (`autobuyer/canister-rs/src/solix2`, docs/v9/canister-only-solana.md
//! §2, §3.3, §5, W2). One end-to-end flow of spike S1/S2 (`tests/s1_canister_only.rs`) in LiteSVM against the mainnet bytes of
//! Meteora DBC 0.2.1, DAMM v2 0.2.4 and Metaplex Token Metadata, with **deterministic** keys (`Keypair::new_from_array([n; 32])`),
//! so every address is reproducible. Every instruction is built the spike's way (spl-token / spl-associated-token-account crates,
//! Anchor clients generated by `declare_program!` from the official IDLs in programs/rook_backing/idls), **sent, and recorded only
//! once it has landed**. Accounts the canister must decode are dumped with the values they must decode to (taken from the
//! parameters that created them, or from spl-token's own `unpack`).
//!
//! Output: autobuyer/canister-rs/tests/fixtures/solix2/flow.json (checked by autobuyer/canister-rs/tests/solix2_builders.rs).
//! Run: `cargo test -p rook_backing --test solix2_fixtures -- --nocapture`

